      "body": { "en": "The Polish alphabet has 32 letters: a ą b c ć d e ę f g h i j k l ł m n ń o ó p r s ś t u w y z ź ż. Q, v and x appear only in foreign words. Nine letters carry marks, and seven pairs of letters spell one sound each: ch, cz, dz, dź, dż, rz, sz. You have now met them all." }
